      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "That's honest."
    },
    {
      "Id": 101360110,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I thought it was good. It had sufficient calories."
    },
    {
      "Id": 101360120,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "What's next for you, Eimi?"
    },
    {
      "Id": 101360130,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "I'll probably"
